# Choghadiya is a client-only static site — there are NO runtime secrets or
# configuration. This file exists so the "never commit secrets, use .env.example"
# convention has a home. Copy to `.env` only if you add optional local tooling.

# ASSET_VERSION is derived from package.json "version" by `make bump` and drives
# the `?v=` cache-bust tokens. It is NOT read at runtime; shown here for reference.
# ASSET_VERSION=2.2.0
